      "cooked": "<p><span>Handelabra’s next game is finally coming to your phone, just in time for Gen Con!&nbsp;</span><span>We’ve been working with Dice Hate Me Games and Greater Than Games since January to bring the game into the digital world.</span></p><p><strong>Bottom of the 9th</strong><span>&nbsp;will be available for iOS and Android phones for $4.99. Tablet and Steam support will be coming soon!</span></p><p><span>More details here:&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>http://handelabra.com/blog/2017/8/2/bottom-of-the-9th-coming-august-17th</span></p><p><span>http://bot9digital.com</span></p><p><em><span>(scurries back to the code mines)</span></em></p>",
